'''Henry''' (ヒカル, '''''Hikaru''''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Legend Stages]] and [[The Aku Realms]]. He was added in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]].

