==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], Henry is called Hikaru, a common Japanese name meaning "to shine; to give off light". This reference is not passed onto his English name.
**According to a post from the official Battle Cats LINE account, his parents chose the name Hikaru because they wanted him to shine. Ironically, despite his weakness to parental pressure, he failed the university entrance exams 9 times in a row and eventually became [[Lophiiformes Angaburu]] after he was killed in his 10th attempt.
*Despite being male, Henry's appearance is that of a female anglerfish; males are much smaller and don't have lures.
**However, his Japanese description mentions that he synthesized his lure himself as opposed to having it naturally.

